<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Schneider.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Schneider.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued six million call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Schneider, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS  STRIKE   ISS PRICE   PREMIUM     GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> CALL A    270.0    2.96 FRF    20.32 PCT   8.4 X    17.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL B    310.0    3.11 FRF    36.99 PCT   8.0 X    17.MAR.99</p>
<p> PAYDATE	12.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  249.00</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
